    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Greedy in the Dark is a slow-paced platformer game with metroidvania elements. You venture into the dark caves under an abandoned factory to loot stuff. Of course, you didn't bring any equipment for navigation in the dark (it's pricey these days), but you are 100% sure that there will be something to exchange it for.<br><br><strong>\u25ba Explore the dark and find treasures hidden within, then use your phone to trade them for something</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641340/extras/1ee7aa5c95d044c285a2daa23f929322.poster.avif?t=1710355958\" width=600 height=339 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641340/extras/1ee7aa5c95d044c285a2daa23f929322.webm?t=1710355958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u25ba Buy tools to navigate the map:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Flashlight \u2013 increases player sight<br></li><li>Echo locator \u2013 reveals walls and platforms<br></li><li>Metal detector \u2013 shows traps<br></li><li>Thermal camera \u2013 shows enemies</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641340/extras/614b5802837b58e0f735cf220c872069.poster.avif?t=1710355958\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641340/extras/614b5802837b58e0f735cf220c872069.webm?t=1710355958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u25ba and more...</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641340/extras/3c3207b68a20c299dd04d55d87ca2ee6.poster.avif?t=1710355958\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641340/extras/3c3207b68a20c299dd04d55d87ca2ee6.webm?t=1710355958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
